<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3865/70  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7195/05  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9346/51  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4395/05  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.45/46   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8090/10  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1695.0/5.5 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     112.35/45  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.7530/80  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.1634/84  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5470/90  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6350/60</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$343.05/35</p>
</text>
